# Design system (nomorecallcenter)

Read root `DESIGN.md` and `design/tokens/md3-colors.json` before UI work.

## Must

- Material Design 3 **role tokens** only (primary, onSurface, surfaceContainer*, outline*, error*, …).
- Web: **UnoCSS** aliases/shortcuts/attributes — no new ad-hoc CSS files.
- Web: **Reka UI** primitives first; custom only if Reka cannot express the pattern.
- Android: **Compose Material 3** `ColorScheme` / typography aligned to the same role names.
- French UI copy; PRD terminology (rejet silencieux, liste globale, proposition).

## Must not

- Copy Stitch `code.html` as production UI (page-to-page drift).
- Use **Inter** (Stitch default) — web **Roboto Flex/Roboto**; Android platform Roboto.
- Invent product claims: 100% offline, SQLite-as-backend, P2P/federation, open signup.
- Hardcode random hex in templates — extend tokens instead.

## Shared layer

App + admin extend the Nuxt shared layer (BAJO-shaped). Histoire documents components; keep Histoire out of consumer `nuxt.config`.
